{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's World of Tanks Blitz, a legendary action-adventure tank game. Blitz is not about war, but tanks! Join this action-packed PvP shooter and explore unique vehicles and a variety of battlefields. Experience the adrenaline rush of intense tank battles that test your skills and strategy. <br><br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This FREE tank game keeps you engaged and brings everyday challenges and unique events.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444200/extras/a69c8b69c1869c3b0cc8cb4883c7e643.avif?t=1759998804\" width=616 height=1876 /></span>  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/444200?t=1759998804","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444200/87ac15a672ed66bb2edab612ccacc5d384cc52c2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759998804","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444200/501cb64165fd74f7aca258252e148d8a7234ced5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759998804","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444200/501cb64165fd74f7aca258252e148d8a7234ced5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759998804","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444200/extras/6f64701f1cd4027cb1195231c0809955.avif?t=1759998804\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 A spook-tacular October is upon us! The Garage is aglow in sinister colors, and\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Alpenstadt's streets are shrouded in night; the map lit by sparse lanterns, toxic mushrooms, and pumpkins! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 New mode: Infected Front. Help survivalists and become their hero! Or lead a horde of undead to victory, infecting every enemy in your path! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Test your skills in the month's spooky activities and expand your collection with new tanks and camos!</p></p><br><h1>Update Notes</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mystical Garage, a night map, a new mode, and spooky events\u2014that\u2019s the perfect October in WoT Blitz!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's World of Tanks Blitz, a legendary action-adventure tank game. Blitz is not about war, but tanks! Join this action-packed PvP shooter and explore unique vehicles and a variety of battlefields. Experience the adrenaline rush of intense tank battles that test your skills and strategy. <br><br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This FREE tank game keeps you engaged and brings everyday challenges and unique events.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444200/extras/a69c8b69c1869c3b0cc8cb4883c7e643.avif?t=1759998804\" width=616 height=1876 /></span>  </p>","developers":["Wargaming Group Limited"],"dlc":[2446220,2994440,2994450,2994270,2994300,2994290,2994310,2994350,2994370,2994360,2994420,2994410,2994380,2994400,2994390],"ext_user_account_notice":"Wargaming.net (Support